ed from another skill. Crucial layout: make each effect COMPACT, occupying only the middle 55% of its cell. The strongest third and fourth phases need the same wide empty transparent margin as the quiet phases. Crisp separate hard-edged GOLD CRYSTAL PLATES, dark amber facets and bright fracture lines, not a cloudy golden circle or soft fog. The middle hole and gaps between chunks must be truly transparent.",
